msgid ""
"\"Squash\" your commits. See :ref:`git-interactive-rebase`. There should be "
"onlt one commit for changes related to a given topical change, even if "
"multiple pages with changes are involved."
msgstr ""
"\"压缩（Squash）\"你的提交。参见 :ref:`git-interactive-"
"rebase`。同一主题的修改应只有一个提交，即使涉及多个页面的改动。"
